B.S8=new A.fL("Fyodor Dostoevsky","1821\u20131881",'The Russian novelist lived with epilepsy for most of his adult life and wrote some of literature\'s most detailed first-person accounts of an epileptic aura \u2014 the "ecstatic aura" he describes in The Idiot and elsewhere is still discussed in neurology and is widely considered consistent with temporal lobe epilepsy.',B.e7)
B.S5=new A.fL("Harriet Tubman","c. 1822\u20131913","The American abolitionist developed seizures, severe headaches and hypersomnolence after being struck in the head as a teenager \u2014 an injury and its after-effects that are well documented in her biographies and that she lived with for the rest of her life.",B.e7)
